'''''Obsequies Performed, A Long Road Ahead''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Karmic Clouds Faded, War Banners Folded]].

==Steps==
# Head to the Seat of Divine Foresight to ask about the situation
# Go through the events surrounding the Ambrosial Arbor's calamity with Fu Xuan
# Head to the Palace of Astrum and give Yukong the item that has been entrusted to you
# (Optional) Plan for the future after discussions with your companions
# Sort through Tingyun's things with Yanming
# Give the gift to Mengming from the Sleepless Earl
# Arrive at Aurum Alley
# Give the gift to Yancui from Spices Supreme
# Give the gift to Yukong in Stargazer Navalia
# Select which of the gifts returned by the people you wish to place into the ceremony starskiff
# Head to Starskiff Haven and participate in the soul-soothing ceremony
# Accept the token of alliance from Jing Yuan
# Plan for the future after discussions with your companions
# (Optional) Before you return to the Express, bid farewell to the people you got to know on Xianzhou
# Return to the Express and report back to Himeko
# Go to Stargazer Navalia and meet Yukong, who is overseeing the ceremony's preparations

